        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>2</sup> RulesPal: &ldquo;tiles beside hyperlanes, and a system enclosed by them, aren&rsquo;t edge systems.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li>The number of units in the system is irrelevant, if there is at least one.<sup>2,4</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>2</sup> RulesPal, &ldquo;Does Defy Space and Time need more than one unit in the Wormhole Nexus?&rdquo;: &ldquo;No &mdash; one unit is enough; the plural is just the card template.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li><i>Destroy Their Greatest Ship</i> is scored as soon as the war sun or flagship is destroyed; it does not require waiting until the end of the combat.<sup>2</sup>
